  "description": "Lee Sol is an art student who sees ghosts. While looking for a place to live, she finds an office building. For some reason, the place is full of ghosts, but the price is too cheap. However, the residents are a bit strange. With a year and a half to go until she graduates from university, will she be able to survive in this apartment?\n\n(Source: Manhwakyung, translated)",
